Subject: Select scalar original zero-morph weighted software equations
Upstream-base: 443164c91fded218656a8443432e642fdad57838

Preserve paired-single mul/madd/add grouping and bone-outer accumulation.
Native helpers use explicit fused single-precision multiply-add and retain
authored unnormalized weights/normals. Nonzero morphs fail explicitly; the
console assembly remains intact. Raw ShaderSkinMesh ownership is unselected.

